  "clips": [
    {
      "file": "ru/CH07_P03_L001_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L001",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "frame_id": "1 — зелёное существо",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Ха-ха! Конечно же нет, Мика. Ты попал ко мне потому, что…",
      "emotion": "добрый, лёгкий смех; мягкое отрицание",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 5200,
      "sha256": "14fbd9faef682da2c865bf3e1a2fe299dc00e99be2d6655c419f6ddbcf11804e"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH07_P03_L002_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L002",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "frame_id": "2 — цветок среди камней",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Ты разгадал: жизнь всегда найдёт возможность пробиться.",
      "emotion": "тёплое объяснение, восторг жизни",
      "emotion_tag": "[with wonder]",
      "duration_ms": 4560,
      "sha256": "ee8b7b82ab50d29bf8638bc65c7bf7927df321b7ffe634996668509c2a363ce7"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH07_P03_L003_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L003",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "frame_id": "3A — Земля",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "На Земле господствующие формы жизни сменяли друг друга.",
      "emotion": "спокойное рассуждение",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtfully]",
      "duration_ms": 4320,
      "sha256": "f7ec104bb757e9a4dd88bdf2588083fbad2a6372036d216e1b5daef8b0e67c95"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH07_P03_L004_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L004",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "frame_id": "3B — мир плесени",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "В мире, где жизнь почти угасла, на руинах возникла новая.",
      "emotion": "надежда, возрождение",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopefully]",
      "duration_ms": 4880,
      "sha256": "1cc976e46411fe27274859a0c97f479a1cf8d2a5768d2cef3bc51bcfddfadde4"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH07_P03_L005_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L005",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "frame_id": "3C — фазовые существа",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Даже в холодных каменных структурах могла заискриться жизнь.",
      "emotion": "удивление, возможность нового",
      "emotion_tag": "[with wonder]",
      "duration_ms": 4240,
      "sha256": "850f96d8ba8dcfc69061b88c514a165f3c7bdf855db5821297e8dd5f4b50fa6a"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH07_P03_L006_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L006",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": "3D — симбиоз",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "А иногда разные формы жизни объединяются.",
      "emotion": "тёплое удивление",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 3760,
      "sha256": "d51716e28d0cc3e49e83be2c423b8211e13db26f14c72ee13aa7b8ea0528987a"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH07_P03_L007_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L007",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "frame_id": "4 — магнитный мир",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Но та аномалия, которая произошла с магнитными существами, произошла не только с ними.",
      "emotion": "важная подсказка, нарастающая интрига",
      "emotion_tag": "[seriously]",
      "duration_ms": 5600,
      "sha256": "62d74b9bc293a8b4a6d8fb12cb7f469cfdb8c936dd93c024b7dd85ab6ac30330"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH07_P03_L008_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L008",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "frame_id": "5 — Мика и магнитное существо",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Вы и магнитные жители — из одного и того же мира.",
      "emotion": "мягкое, важное откровение",
      "emotion_tag": "[gently]",
      "duration_ms": 4160,
      "sha256": "ad0e57aedfece6c5bfad5ef985f0febaf472a57156630422526c7df82236f6c4"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH07_P03_L009_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L009",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "frame_id": "6A — эхо прошлого",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Но эхо событий вашего мира дошло до нас лишь спустя миллионы лет.",
      "emotion": "таинственное раскрытие временной дистанции",
      "emotion_tag": "[mysteriously]",
      "duration_ms": 5280,
      "sha256": "39a74e07829d0f2e1c5c8605943b50493c741e27a9428f884dbbfc571f3665f3"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH07_P03_L010_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L010",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 10,
      "frame_id": "6B — осознание нейронных существ",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "И только сейчас нейронные жители смогли отправить сигнал магнитным людям, чтобы они создали канал, который позволил тебе спастись, пройдя сквозь время и пространство.",
      "emotion": "прояснение тайны, глубокое сочувствие и надежда",
      "emotion_tag": "[reassuringly]",
      "duration_ms": 10800,
      "sha256": "ad80d38c6a9fa9d3aa9aa6c1c7ddd9561cab45adb53d45a819ded9c7e80b24b9"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH07_P03_L001_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L001",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "frame_id": "1 — зелёное существо",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Ha-ha! Of course not, Mika. You came to me because...",
      "emotion": "добрый, лёгкий смех; мягкое отрицание",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 4720,
      "sha256": "cdf947684d8c2e77ee0072483a4b1f8a9adbb42a3045a28a1c13b1b26be105b0"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH07_P03_L002_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L002",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "frame_id": "2 — цветок среди камней",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "You figured it out: life will always find a way to break through.",
      "emotion": "тёплое объяснение, восторг жизни",
      "emotion_tag": "[with wonder]",
      "duration_ms": 4560,
      "sha256": "e44100be0bc5daa2fa94e8e949d0347160f2f1be16d5465d3abf91738b775d9b"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH07_P03_L003_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L003",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "frame_id": "3A — Земля",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "On Earth, dominant forms of life replaced one another.",
      "emotion": "спокойное рассуждение",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtfully]",
      "duration_ms": 4160,
      "sha256": "3de13844bf2187c56672f317271107f2d7ae0f80c8531d2d0263a96a76248558"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH07_P03_L004_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L004",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "frame_id": "3B — мир плесени",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "In a world where life had nearly faded away, new life arose from the ruins.",
      "emotion": "надежда, возрождение",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopefully]",
      "duration_ms": 5520,
      "sha256": "57ae5ddf21fff7bf5479c7225e69e7e45242ebb5b1b40be81bb90f839b26155b"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH07_P03_L005_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L005",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "frame_id": "3C — фазовые существа",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Even in cold, stony structures, life could begin to sparkle.",
      "emotion": "удивление, возможность нового",
      "emotion_tag": "[with wonder]",
      "duration_ms": 4800,
      "sha256": "daf2669b9c011d7fa3fc40c3fad73113e9bcfeac0bfdb404582212ca174fcc28"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH07_P03_L006_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L006",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": "3D — симбиоз",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "And sometimes different forms of life join together.",
      "emotion": "тёплое удивление",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 3680,
      "sha256": "5ac802c4d3e521b0b459fe8a0c4c286f9eee6b9a8c033e53e3b59b12320da3d1"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH07_P03_L007_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L007",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "frame_id": "4 — магнитный мир",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "But the anomaly that happened to the magnetic beings did not happen only to them.",
      "emotion": "важная подсказка, нарастающая интрига",
      "emotion_tag": "[seriously]",
      "duration_ms": 4880,
      "sha256": "be59237cb0e0d8bb549db9252812d8afce11d6472a8ab7246eb4f0f2be70ee7d"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH07_P03_L008_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L008",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "frame_id": "5 — Мика и магнитное существо",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "You and the magnetic inhabitants come from the very same world.",
      "emotion": "мягкое, важное откровение",
      "emotion_tag": "[gently]",
      "duration_ms": 4320,
      "sha256": "1764d223230fa50146ff146aaffdfc38a0f5e3373a47c4e73946fca72d4b18c3"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH07_P03_L009_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L009",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "frame_id": "6A — эхо прошлого",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "But the echo of the events in your world reached us only millions of years later.",
      "emotion": "таинственное раскрытие временной дистанции",
      "emotion_tag": "[mysteriously]",
      "duration_ms": 5200,
      "sha256": "9815f3360398872a98ed80b334833ed4460b27a997b77a3f1692d966641abc5a"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH07_P03_L010_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L010",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 10,
      "frame_id": "6B — осознание нейронных существ",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "And only now were the neuron dwellers able to send a signal to the magnetic people so they could create a channel that allowed you to be saved by passing through time and space.",
      "emotion": "прояснение тайны, глубокое сочувствие и надежда",
      "emotion_tag": "[reassuringly]",
      "duration_ms": 10080,
      "sha256": "9d5838c4e51d3915d00776b7aa72085bb2243e71099a5b225a1ed706a24de34d"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH07_P03_L001_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L001",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "frame_id": "1 — зелёное существо",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Ha, ha! Claro que não, Mika. Você chegou até mim porque...",
      "emotion": "добрый, лёгкий смех; мягкое отрицание",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 5280,
      "sha256": "a3a4eabdde997c8b98555c6bcb58ce80382cfe1b75e4fabf23fff03490f3df3a"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH07_P03_L002_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L002",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "frame_id": "2 — цветок среди камней",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Você descobriu: a vida sempre encontra um jeito de abrir caminho.",
      "emotion": "тёплое объяснение, восторг жизни",
      "emotion_tag": "[with wonder]",
      "duration_ms": 4880,
      "sha256": "42d70abfa13418c45c373266c7800e6258e811a3f90437f21db79413633370d9"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH07_P03_L003_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L003",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "frame_id": "3A — Земля",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Na Terra, as formas de vida dominantes foram se substituindo.",
      "emotion": "спокойное рассуждение",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtfully]",
      "duration_ms": 4720,
      "sha256": "ddb3bec76ba2602d5ebf48a270b5f3995b5e27196afc6db5eee309cbfe42a2fe"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH07_P03_L004_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L004",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "frame_id": "3B — мир плесени",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Num mundo onde a vida quase se apagou, uma nova surgiu sobre as ruínas.",
      "emotion": "надежда, возрождение",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopefully]",
      "duration_ms": 5280,
      "sha256": "546ce814c004c6a0a30f659160402584d36b5a4f063cd0c0bb4c655a4a4d8d06"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH07_P03_L005_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L005",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "frame_id": "3C — фазовые существа",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Até em estruturas frias e rochosas a vida pôde começar a cintilar.",
      "emotion": "удивление, возможность нового",
      "emotion_tag": "[with wonder]",
      "duration_ms": 5280,
      "sha256": "6017998a7b7b15e23317466d903dc64970e3785108f0b9e007e87d5437e75ba7"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH07_P03_L006_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L006",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": "3D — симбиоз",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "E às vezes diferentes formas de vida se unem.",
      "emotion": "тёплое удивление",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 3760,
      "sha256": "b2aa219e71b2d31d8a3889e3125446903c099286bc7ec7be52ca738303a94d01"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH07_P03_L007_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L007",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "frame_id": "4 — магнитный мир",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Mas a anomalia que aconteceu com os seres magnéticos não aconteceu só com eles.",
      "emotion": "важная подсказка, нарастающая интрига",
      "emotion_tag": "[seriously]",
      "duration_ms": 5200,
      "sha256": "4f771c025b0532afa203e49a55cb71c82c5ec7a448e1fb2d424fb01daa068bd8"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH07_P03_L008_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L008",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "frame_id": "5 — Мика и магнитное существо",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Você e os habitantes magnéticos vêm do mesmo mundo.",
      "emotion": "мягкое, важное откровение",
      "emotion_tag": "[gently]",
      "duration_ms": 4160,
      "sha256": "c093884ce179bdde51e3cc0702c5facd188aaf2025f124244e7cf9ec76c959d6"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH07_P03_L009_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L009",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "frame_id": "6A — эхо прошлого",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Mas o eco dos acontecimentos do seu mundo chegou até nós apenas milhões de anos depois.",
      "emotion": "таинственное раскрытие временной дистанции",
      "emotion_tag": "[mysteriously]",
      "duration_ms": 6400,
      "sha256": "84c26303da0cb817c7588cd5b182e6c8926eb74c3356fcd78123651dd0c77c94"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH07_P03_L010_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L010",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 10,
      "frame_id": "6B — осознание нейронных существ",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "E só agora os habitantes neurais conseguiram enviar um sinal ao povo magnético para que eles criassem um canal que permitiu que você fosse salvo, atravessando o tempo e o espaço.",
      "emotion": "прояснение тайны, глубокое сочувствие и надежда",
      "emotion_tag": "[reassuringly]",
      "duration_ms": 10960,
      "sha256": "448096230e11bf199ff1f0e2d18f7b393efd6b6e24f66eb667fd8aee9fd67738"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH07_P03_L001_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L001",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "frame_id": "1 — зелёное существо",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Ja, ja. Claro que no, Mika. Llegaste hasta mí porque...",
      "emotion": "добрый, лёгкий смех; мягкое отрицание",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 5120,
      "sha256": "34c434d3b7747bd158d8037198069836b368c14702931aeda48c8260b1314469"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH07_P03_L002_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L002",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "frame_id": "2 — цветок среди камней",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Lo entendiste: la vida siempre encuentra una forma de abrirse camino.",
      "emotion": "тёплое объяснение, восторг жизни",
      "emotion_tag": "[with wonder]",
      "duration_ms": 5200,
      "sha256": "c683fb102da9f148910ca143d7d18f62636c74a2d72258e328e48edbb050aef6"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH07_P03_L003_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L003",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "frame_id": "3A — Земля",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "En la Tierra, las formas de vida dominantes fueron sustituyéndose unas a otras.",
      "emotion": "спокойное рассуждение",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtfully]",
      "duration_ms": 5600,
      "sha256": "8c9256193d40d6ac3d5d33e9c592cfa8495f2558f75f502f2c246c832e44ac8e"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH07_P03_L004_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L004",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "frame_id": "3B — мир плесени",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "En un mundo donde la vida casi se extinguió, una nueva surgió sobre las ruinas.",
      "emotion": "надежда, возрождение",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopefully]",
      "duration_ms": 5680,
      "sha256": "dea0d9361a7bbf1b906d62d77d4e333f6d46470aac13b1fbb0a8ea114c2557fa"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH07_P03_L005_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L005",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "frame_id": "3C — фазовые существа",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Incluso en estructuras frías y pétreas pudo chispear una nueva vida.",
      "emotion": "удивление, возможность нового",
      "emotion_tag": "[with wonder]",
      "duration_ms": 5120,
      "sha256": "14cd806d5fc04fb7ef6f36975069fa0952ed565fed1e826f5881725232e85477"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH07_P03_L006_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L006",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": "3D — симбиоз",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Y a veces distintas formas de vida se unen.",
      "emotion": "тёплое удивление",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 3600,
      "sha256": "8f1c4f12515dde77493919d0ba10deec4d97effa30d70a9f170bb5b2cc155007"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH07_P03_L007_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L007",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "frame_id": "4 — магнитный мир",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Pero la anomalía que ocurrió con los seres magnéticos no ocurrió solo con ellos.",
      "emotion": "важная подсказка, нарастающая интрига",
      "emotion_tag": "[seriously]",
      "duration_ms": 5120,
      "sha256": "0027c8b697f1aabb7ea98f9a0e1c12d3bb53760d947b39f9bd7c878b84cd2a17"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH07_P03_L008_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L008",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "frame_id": "5 — Мика и магнитное существо",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Tú y los habitantes magnéticos provienen del mismo mundo.",
      "emotion": "мягкое, важное откровение",
      "emotion_tag": "[gently]",
      "duration_ms": 4080,
      "sha256": "adbb8ee55448c024e3d18f4bcfaf1e06751283ba24560a6cd1507c57f084966e"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH07_P03_L009_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L009",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "frame_id": "6A — эхо прошлого",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Pero el eco de los acontecimientos de vuestro mundo nos llegó solo millones de años después.",
      "emotion": "таинственное раскрытие временной дистанции",
      "emotion_tag": "[mysteriously]",
      "duration_ms": 6160,
      "sha256": "41d9a3c6b122b3beecfaea58049f903d095a53eca7327c8fe2c715796a8f7581"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH07_P03_L010_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L010",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 10,
      "frame_id": "6B — осознание нейронных существ",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Y solo ahora los habitantes neuronales pudieron enviar una señal a la gente magnética para que crearan un canal que te permitió salvarte, atravesando el tiempo y el espacio.",
      "emotion": "прояснение тайны, глубокое сочувствие и надежда",
      "emotion_tag": "[reassuringly]",
      "duration_ms": 10320,
      "sha256": "32f1247c80bd3fa71421c344db93c628605375ac2df4b8f25cee69737d7e6db5"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH07_P03_L001_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L001",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "frame_id": "1 — зелёное существо",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Ha-ha ! Bien sûr que non, Mika. Tu es arrivé jusqu’à moi parce que...",
      "emotion": "добрый, лёгкий смех; мягкое отрицание",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 5360,
      "sha256": "7aec9e8d281e3747f0b8d77138f1f5893192ad8caff608151d9a21bafa65392a"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH07_P03_L002_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L002",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "frame_id": "2 — цветок среди камней",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Tu l’as compris : la vie trouve toujours un moyen de se frayer un chemin.",
      "emotion": "тёплое объяснение, восторг жизни",
      "emotion_tag": "[with wonder]",
      "duration_ms": 4720,
      "sha256": "dc5e14b85986f6644638ef40c366f3a6fa351aa0b43804bc080e2e6d2607cbd6"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH07_P03_L003_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L003",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "frame_id": "3A — Земля",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Sur Terre, les formes de vie dominantes se sont succédé.",
      "emotion": "спокойное рассуждение",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtfully]",
      "duration_ms": 4000,
      "sha256": "32ceec874e8c2bdcd5f36f209b95e9da008a53d539cc9755bfc16c457e4a233f"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH07_P03_L004_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L004",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "frame_id": "3B — мир плесени",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Dans un monde où la vie s’était presque éteinte, une nouvelle est née sur les ruines.",
      "emotion": "надежда, возрождение",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopefully]",
      "duration_ms": 4960,
      "sha256": "be7c4412bc1f52c56c34914900b5317f9c702a3961108de300e178e7d197d480"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH07_P03_L005_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L005",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "frame_id": "3C — фазовые существа",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Même dans de froides structures de pierre, la vie a pu commencer à étinceler.",
      "emotion": "удивление, возможность нового",
      "emotion_tag": "[with wonder]",
      "duration_ms": 5280,
      "sha256": "965bc04b713ed27ee23e2e09ca7ada7d54c133d116f86a1d9f7248fe2dfed92d"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH07_P03_L006_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L006",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": "3D — симбиоз",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Et parfois, différentes formes de vie s’unissent.",
      "emotion": "тёплое удивление",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 3440,
      "sha256": "3b0a355dce0ca0ef112a135405bcf260da3fe1e91c14081e1adcb19c32dc3905"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH07_P03_L007_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L007",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "frame_id": "4 — магнитный мир",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Mais l’anomalie qui est arrivée aux êtres magnétiques ne leur est pas arrivée à eux seuls.",
      "emotion": "важная подсказка, нарастающая интрига",
      "emotion_tag": "[seriously]",
      "duration_ms": 4880,
      "sha256": "c0dec831ef16e35baec27046915195442d59772c4cb220e78c7f4a5b9a27de1a"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH07_P03_L008_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L008",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "frame_id": "5 — Мика и магнитное существо",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Toi et les habitants magnétiques venez d’un seul et même monde.",
      "emotion": "мягкое, важное откровение",
      "emotion_tag": "[gently]",
      "duration_ms": 4640,
      "sha256": "43a2436576a68694a9c6359adb8efa15e1701a490880dc23beb5a8c0bc9c8684"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH07_P03_L009_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L009",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "frame_id": "6A — эхо прошлого",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Mais l’écho des événements de votre monde ne nous est parvenu que des millions d’années plus tard.",
      "emotion": "таинственное раскрытие временной дистанции",
      "emotion_tag": "[mysteriously]",
      "duration_ms": 5120,
      "sha256": "2f3801c7a4c42835559185b4ef4fc28b5eb84426f0a4e436cd3d4fc87b2d00d0"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH07_P03_L010_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L010",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 10,
      "frame_id": "6B — осознание нейронных существ",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Et ce n’est que maintenant que les habitants neuronaux ont pu envoyer un signal au peuple magnétique pour qu’ils créent un canal qui t’a permis d’être sauvé en traversant le temps et l’espace.",
      "emotion": "прояснение тайны, глубокое сочувствие и надежда",
      "emotion_tag": "[reassuringly]",
      "duration_ms": 10320,
      "sha256": "a81388783e685e25ca9d003015a1d4be649186a15ee226ad22f68b119be492c4"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH07_P03_L001_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L001",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "frame_id": "1 — зелёное существо",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Ha, ha! Natürlich nicht, Mika. Du bist zu mir gelangt, weil...",
      "emotion": "добрый, лёгкий смех; мягкое отрицание",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 5040,
      "sha256": "11ce9f4b03c2deb1ae11e7316cfad75ac094aad4d65833559ae908f6f88770f3"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH07_P03_L002_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L002",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "frame_id": "2 — цветок среди камней",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Du hast es erkannt: Das Leben findet immer einen Weg, sich durchzusetzen.",
      "emotion": "тёплое объяснение, восторг жизни",
      "emotion_tag": "[with wonder]",
      "duration_ms": 5040,
      "sha256": "11090f6cf8c31059dd9bea0035c87ab1f387b942d49ae251c32875bc452bf3b0"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH07_P03_L003_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L003",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "frame_id": "3A — Земля",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Auf der Erde lösten die dominierenden Lebensformen einander ab.",
      "emotion": "спокойное рассуждение",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtfully]",
      "duration_ms": 4080,
      "sha256": "2a14120fe909e22c0029124088ea7539008bfb6b33a8e444bec2d075bd1a4076"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH07_P03_L004_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L004",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "frame_id": "3B — мир плесени",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "In einer Welt, in der das Leben fast erloschen war, entstand auf den Ruinen neues Leben.",
      "emotion": "надежда, возрождение",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopefully]",
      "duration_ms": 6000,
      "sha256": "9e8e86622ed2e8d550b664e804a5e01229573b669eb70023bdb701ac36e5d34b"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH07_P03_L005_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L005",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "frame_id": "3C — фазовые существа",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Selbst in kalten steinernen Strukturen konnte neues Leben aufleuchten.",
      "emotion": "удивление, возможность нового",
      "emotion_tag": "[with wonder]",
      "duration_ms": 4880,
      "sha256": "13ec2498199e971239a892af63a6a883b512d5ded869e2446cf0a3b9940961fc"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH07_P03_L006_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L006",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": "3D — симбиоз",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Und manchmal verbinden sich unterschiedliche Lebensformen.",
      "emotion": "тёплое удивление",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 3680,
      "sha256": "25a8da3c1c043be8a270695dcca98e3bfc4ac38516cc456bbcbcbff67de63987"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH07_P03_L007_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P03_L007",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "frame_id": "4 — магнитный мир",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_040",
      "role": "living_planet",
      "kind": "dialogue_offscreen",
      "voice_id": "ubsJMIHeKrTU8xhs0Zaa",
      "text": "Doch die Anomalie, die den magnetischen Wesen widerfuhr, betraf nicht nur sie allein.",
